    "We partner with businesses from small and medium sized enterprises to large corporates – supporting every stage of their growth, their international ambitions and their sustainability transitions – through our universal banking capabilities. This includes HSBC Innovation Banking, which supports clients and investors through all business life stages with our deep sector expertise, stability and international reach.",
